{
  "format": "phaenon.json as its readers answer it (../design/tooling.md §3.7, T19): the compiler reading a project's own file (readProject in cmd/phn/project.go), the compiler reading an installed package's (readInstalledProject), and the Composer plugin, which reads installed packages alone (composer/src/ProjectFile.php). \"file\" is the project file's text. \"refused\" marks a file that is in error for all three, and \"error\" is then part of the compiler's error, where the vector holds it to one. Otherwise \"roots\" maps each source root to its output directory and \"committed\" lists the roots whose outputs the project commits, in the file's order, all as cleaned paths with forward slashes. \"root\" marks a file that is in error as a project's own, with part of that error, and is read as given as an installed package's: it has keys the compiler does not know, which \"unknown\" lists, sorted, as both readers of an installed package name them. A file without \"root\" is read alike in both ways, and has no unknown key.",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "no key: the project commits no outputs (D13)",
      "file": "{\"roots\": {\"src\": \".src\", \"tests\": \".tests\"}}",
      "roots": {
        "src": ".src",
        "tests": ".tests"
      },
      "committed": []
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty list is no key",
      "file": "{\"roots\": {\"src\": \".src\"}, \"committed\": []}",
      "roots": {
        "src": ".src"
      },
      "committed": []
    },
    {
      "name": "null is no key",
      "file": "{\"roots\": {\"src\": \".src\"}, \"committed\": null}",
      "roots": {
        "src": ".src"
      },
      "committed": []
    },
    {
      "name": "one root of two: a library commits what its consumers load, not its tests",
      "file": "{\"roots\": {\"src\": \".src\", \"tests\": \".tests\"}, \"committed\": [\"src\"]}",
      "roots": {
        "src": ".src",
        "tests": ".tests"
      },
      "committed": [
        "src"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "every root",
      "file": "{\"roots\": {\"src\": \".src\", \"lib\": \".lib\"}, \"committed\": [\"src\", \"lib\"]}",
      "roots": {
